Package: agrstat
Type: Package
Title: Access Taiwan MOA Agricultural Statistics Dynamic Inquiry
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Liou", email = "yuyou.liou@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Programmatic access to the Taiwan Ministry of Agriculture (MOA)
    agricultural statistics "dynamic inquiry" system
    (<https://agrstat.moa.gov.tw/sdweb/public/inquiry/InquireAdvance.aspx>).
    The package drives the ASP.NET WebForms query wizard step by step:
    list categories, list datasets within a category, inspect the available
    classification axes (dimensions), and download the resulting table as a
    tidy data frame. Selection of categories, datasets, classification
    members and the time range is fully controllable via function arguments.
